@startuml F7.5-D02-criar-template
title F7.5-D02 — Criar template
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CTController" as Ctrl
participant "CreateTemplateUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: Salvar novo template
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /admin/templates-comunicacao
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: INSERT template\n+ revisão CURRENT\n+ audit_log
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> WebApp: 201
WebApp --> Admin: template na lista

@enduml
